`EntityState.livery` is `Record<string,string> | null`, and `Livery` is `{hull, accent, trim}`. In `selfShipStateFrom`, the type of livery in `SelfShipInput` is `Record<string,string> | null`. The panel expects a Livery with 3 slots. Validation is required: convert to Livery only if all 3 hex keys are present, otherwise null.

Fix for updatePanelShip:
```tsx
livery: toPanelLivery(e.livery),
```
Along with:
```tsx
function toPanelLivery(l: Record<string, string> | null | undefined): Livery | null {
  if (!l) return null;
  const hex = /^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$/;
  const hull = l.hull;
  const accent = l.accent;
  const trim = l.trim;
  if (
    typeof hull === 'string' && typeof accent === 'string' && typeof trim === 'string' &&
    hex.test(hull) && hex.test(accent) && hex.test(trim)
  ) {
    return { hull, accent, trim };
  }
  return null;
}
```
Place it at module level, near EMPTY_PANEL_SHIP.

